  "what_the_study_did": "The authors reviewed the reproducibility of landmark preclinical cancer research findings and the ability of industry to validate these findings for drug development.",
  "what_it_found": "A significant proportion of landmark preclinical cancer research findings were not reproducible, and only about 25% of published preclinical studies could be validated for drug development.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Many landmark findings in preclinical oncology research are not reproducible, in part because of inadequate cell lines and animal models.",
      "topic": "Reproducibility Issue"
    },
    {
      "quote": "Historically, our ability to translate cancer research to clinical success has been remarkably low.",
      "topic": "Low Translation Rate"
